WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
My lord, I shocked and killed several enemy generals in front.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,880
One shot kills King Kong, rumored to be fierce

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,040
No one in the world knows

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,160
Mr. Li is my dynasty

5
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,720
The well-deserved No. 1 fighter gives up

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,480
Are your eyeballs used to breathe?

7
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,640
Open your dog eyes and take a look

8
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,320
I am a righteous civil servant

9
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,840
It was the great plan of the civil servants who planned the Uyghur victory thousands of miles away.

10
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:16,760
Don’t you dare to do it again?

11
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:22,620
Believe it or not, I'm going to tear your mouths apart. Sir, calm down and I will swear to resign. I think it's my opinion.

12
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,020
The most brutal among the four great generals

13
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,940
It must be Li Changshi of the Ministry of War. No need to guess.

14
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,740
I heard that Mr. Li can live and die tigers and leopards

15
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,180
Definitely the number one beast in my court

16
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,180
Powerless and invincible

17
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,500
Let me say it one last time

18
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,420
I am a scholar and a counselor

19
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:35,900
Dare to spread rumors again that a certain family is a fierce general?

20
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,980
I'll lure all your heads off to act like smoke tigers

21
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:38,940
Mr. Li, please spare my life.

22
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,140
The boys are guilty

23
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:42,820
Her Majesty the Queen's decree arrives

24
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,500
The commander-in-chief, Shangshu of the Ministry of War, received the order

25
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,380
The remnants of the Qi army joined forces for revenge and have reached the border.

26
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,860
Gu En and Li Shangshu are both brave and unparalleled. The hearts of the people and the hearts of the military are the same.

27
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,020
The special number one Meng led Huixia

28
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,220
Zhao Guang Ma Wei Zhang Meng Three Generals

29
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:55,820
Rushing to the hidden area to raise me is greater than the national prestige. Marshal Li, please take the seal of command.

30
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:56,860
Take command immediately and go to war

31
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:58,500
A certain family is fleeing to protect themselves and recruiting soldiers.

32
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,580
Why did it end

33
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,620
You still have to let me lead the charge.
